<p>A migrant boat that left Libya carrying roughly 100 to 105 people capsized in the central Mediterranean, leaving more than 70 people missing and at least two confirmed dead, according to survivors and rescue groups. Nearby merchant ships rescued 32 survivors near Italy. The disaster is another reminder of the dangers on the Libya-to-Europe crossing, one of the Mediterranean&#x27;s deadliest migration routes. Survivors&#x27; accounts helped shape the estimate of how many people are missing, while nongovernmental groups including Sea-Watch and Mediterranea Saving Humans drew attention to the scale of the loss and the need for continued search-and-rescue efforts.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/Pidgp624m8Xir8ECy4ttrWK1QvUJeK5NVPDvDjh-ysT696CSQ768BKYvNDJWI-wDx3DvLvOT8m_DLjO0sADkkAktjhOiIDo6LCHln7vLcd04JYp1veJ6JvXMEcAOOcRuQ28WsYTg7-JJy9qjhloN8f3q_GY1Be_6THR2wMsNgd25hyR_y6OIomD21bNkD1LPG6tmWML_4c_UHA' alt='A photograph released by the nongovernmental organization Sea-Watch showing migrants on a capsized boat off Libya on Saturday.' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Passenger estimate: Survivors said the boat carried about 105 people, and their accounts were used to estimate that around 71 people were lost at sea.</li><li>Route danger: Migrants continue to take the central Mediterranean route from Libya toward Europe despite repeated fatal shipwrecks.</li></ul><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>Sea-Watch and Mediterranea Saving Humans: The NGOs said more than 70 people were feared dead after the boat capsized, using survivor accounts and rescue information to highlight the scale of the loss. (<a href='http://www.euronews.com/2026/04/05/more-than-70-people-feared-dead-after-migrant-boat-capsizes-in-the-central-mediterranean'>Euronews</a>)</li><li>Survivors: People rescued from the wreck told responders that at least 100 people had been aboard when the vessel left Libya for Europe. (<a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/04/05/world/europe/migrants-missing-boat-capsize-libya.html'>The New York Times</a>)</li><li>Merchant ships and rescue charities: Charities said nearby commercial vessels carried out the first lifesaving response near Italy, rescuing 32 survivors over Easter weekend. (<a href='https://www.straitstimes.com/world/europe/ships-near-italy-rescue-32-migrants-71-lost-at-sea-charities-say'>The Straits Times</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://allafrica.com/stories/202604060104.html'>Liberia: Dozens Missing After Migrant Boat Capsizes in Mediterranean</a> - allafrica.com</li><li><a href='https://www.dw.com/en/dozens-missing-after-migrant-boat-capsizes-in-mediterranean/a-76674357'>Dozens missing after migrant boat capsizes in Mediterranean</a> - dw.com</li><li><a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/04/05/world/europe/migrants-missing-boat-capsize-libya.html'>More Than 70 Migrants Missing After Boat Capsizes Off Libya</a> - nytimes.com</li><li><a href='http://www.euronews.com/2026/04/05/more-than-70-people-feared-dead-after-migrant-boat-capsizes-in-the-central-mediterranean'>More than 70 people feared dead after migrant boat capsizes in the central Mediterranean</a> - euronews.com</li><li><a href='https://www.aljazeera.com/video/newsfeed/2026/4/5/dozens-missing-after-boat-carrying-migrants-capsizes-near-libya'>Dozens missing after boat carrying migrants capsizes near Libya</a> - aljazeera.com</li><li><a href='https://www.straitstimes.com/world/europe/ships-near-italy-rescue-32-migrants-71-lost-at-sea-charities-say'>Ships near Italy rescue 32 migrants, 71 lost at sea, charities say</a> - straitstimes.com</li></ul>